 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_716a6aa231cfd3b2f60c",
   "sourceHash": "716a6aa231cfd3b2f60cc534afdd8a3c1c54ba4bb9aa162e48764d50cb4f5343",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]阿育吠陀疗法和药物源自天然来源，与常规治疗相比，安全性较好，副作用较少。[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0c86936b747940cdce0d",
   "sourceHash": "0c86936b747940cdce0dc41c972121f59956c4cbe8050c448b2624b7842fc870",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]阿育吠陀眼部护理可作为常规治疗的补充，有助于缓解症状、促进康复，并可能减少用药需求。它注重预防，由经验丰富的阿育吠陀医师实施，提供高水准的护理。[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a4242d761fb68f70a5df",
   "sourceHash": "a4242d761fb68f70a5dfdfb00c5ca67c01293dc7e23da24847572261d4ee1741",
   "text": "视力健康与眼部焕活疗法的[[OPEN_1]]益处[[CLOSE_1]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_41e044145a301869ee18",
   "sourceHash": "41e044145a301869ee185603c131687e31c0773ca7fa83a8b8a0425336a941f4",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]阿育吠陀眼部护理有助于提升视物清晰度，减轻眼睛疲劳和劳损。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d57ac1222e9f525182a4",
   "sourceHash": "d57ac1222e9f525182a4292e936156e7072a3fedd409694be039c74f07ba5c28",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]它可缓解眼睛干涩、不适和炎症，同时促进眼部血液循环和营养供给，并强健眼部组织。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8ade73824616c6adf9b7",
   "sourceHash": "8ade73824616c6adf9b77e129382337baa10c456b1e97b72512fe62e97bb4bbd",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]阿育吠陀治疗还可平衡体质能量（dosha），促进整体健康，提升专注力，并有助于预防与年龄相关的眼部疾病。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ec3f4c7c93043846c8e4",
   "sourceHash": "ec3f4c7c93043846c8e4c1bea87b54c0acefcb5f3e471f00d444371c3eedcc33",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]总之，这些疗法有助于改善整体眼部健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_26f28aa40e3693e8a435",
   "sourceHash": "26f28aa40e3693e8a4350d0fff022e643c4a869b1b9e7341715add3b151d3c7a",
   "text": "您的阿育吠陀眼部护理治疗项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_843eaa942f0608abbaa5",
   "sourceHash": "843eaa942f0608abbaa5142d85dd0f62b80b43e4f727ec0db8d1ec34f578413a",
   "text": "自然护眼：一位患者关于希望与清晰视野的故事",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Client' rendered as 患者 (patient) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_eb6d3c6b872e3e2e7366",
   "sourceHash": "eb6d3c6b872e3e2e7366ef890ed24c50a9bc8a4d44817811796665ba12ae892b",
   "text": "在 Kairali，我长期存在的眼睛疲劳问题得到了缓解。治疗过程令人放松，我几乎立刻就能感受到效果。我的视物更清晰了，即使长时间工作后，眼睛的疲劳感也减轻了。这个项目帮助我重新找回了身体的自然平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_300d2efc0f9b87208c92",
   "sourceHash": "300d2efc0f9b87208c92626f6e139fafea57dff193ed32e0fa2b6d04b4cf1173",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Mrs Mony Mathew[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Personal name, star rating and number are language-neutral.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fd2a8c0c75b110ddb7dc",
   "sourceHash": "fd2a8c0c75b110ddb7dc00566494dd0b4a8c7c3147ace8c71de8ba1c44bf3fd0",
   "text": "这会取代我的眼科医生的治疗吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_80ddceadc742c0e6593d",
   "sourceHash": "80ddceadc742c0e6593d66f8f0f702a31c25ce0d168a9d38ac47e06a442db68c",
   "text": "请继续与您的眼科医护人员沟通眼部问题。请询问本项目旨在提供哪些支持，以及它如何与您目前接受的治疗相配合。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_70e64e33bf30f1541944",
   "sourceHash": "70e64e33bf30f15419441be473330bd3c17cc6f789b9bbf7d5d4241bf0d46a55",
   "text": "视力健康与眼部焕活疗法 Netram Chikitsa（奇基察）（Kairali 的眼部护理治疗项目）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source joins two headings without a space ('TherapyNetram'); a space was inserted in the translation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b8a56fb4fa7ef3cb8b28",
   "sourceHash": "b8a56fb4fa7ef3cb8b28f3531f65ed9422ceecfc52bed8a6d223fac0b4228f97",
   "text": "Kairali 阿育吠陀眼部护理与视力疗法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b9a106716cc5a4d73d64",
   "sourceHash": "b9a106716cc5a4d73d64f83edb40c0c6659380fc945c7f19615f817ac8790e48",
   "text": "在患者闭合的双眼周围围起面团圈，进行 Netra Tarpana（眼部滋养疗法）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7a6c7c1cae87584c7c3a",
   "sourceHash": "7a6c7c1cae87584c7c3a6b391181666666cf8d68a7330d2a6a112d7555d4c3e1",
   "text": "治疗师将草药油倒入以链条悬挂的黄铜滴油（dhara）容器中",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_753034c4d59e55c88513",
   "sourceHash": "753034c4d59e55c88513daa2bf158f0087c55e23e66ad3a0992bf55213b4d7bb",
   "text": "Kairali 的阿育吠陀眼部护理疗法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d137604bc04bccf045dc",
   "sourceHash": "d137604bc04bccf045dc69870d568c2441adbbab3802be0029c2589e45561a41",
   "text": "Kairali 阿育吠陀眼部护理的益处",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6e303c70bff692adc66c",
   "sourceHash": "6e303c70bff692adc66c994cf84e855a97f5e0a7cecc6ab47d439b11fcf86c7a",
   "text": "由阿育吠陀医生进行初诊，评估您的具体眼部状况、病史和整体健康状况。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_17a111f512139b45a0d1",
   "sourceHash": "17a111f512139b45a0d1bf368065c70a806c16229c312514572db8373a9de01e",
   "text": "阿育吠陀医生将诊断潜在的失衡，并确定您眼部状况的根本原因。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_27609d397fd7b9133765",
   "sourceHash": "27609d397fd7b91337659387e02311c5d019c7217a90efe1c3e2ca66c41aa0ae",
   "text": "将根据您的个人需求制定个性化治疗方案，其中可能包括多种疗法、草药药物、饮食调整和生活方式建议的组合。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9f2e8ccb07ae2d620e02",
   "sourceHash": "9f2e8ccb07ae2d620e021b8dd002a727e972ab110aa0f80f3c293504100fc90a",
   "text": "患者将接受特定的阿育吠陀疗法，例如 Nasyam（鼻腔给予药油）、Netra Tarpanam（眼部焕活疗法）和 Netra Basti（药物洗眼）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6b5763afa6211231bb2c",
   "sourceHash": "6b5763afa6211231bb2c70042cc05c450ec1d2f5860ae0c0c5a716bae5227f1c",
   "text": "药物",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6b131ffaf1eeca49a67b",
   "sourceHash": "6b131ffaf1eeca49a67b490c0a537c95611a9d7eaa270838a9365fbc0d543b12",
   "text": "可能会开具草药药物和眼药水，以滋养眼睛并促进康复。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
